{%- comment -%}
  Outputs the built-in photo name for a symptom icon (assets mt-symptom-[name]-480.webp and -720.webp),
  or nothing when there is no photo for that icon. "Pain while eating" shares the hand-on-cheek photo.

  Accepts:
  - icon: {String} symptom icon, for example 's-open'

  Usage:
  {%- capture photo -%}{% render 'mt-symptom-photo', icon: block.settings.icon %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case icon -%}
  {%- when 's-open' -%}open
  {%- when 's-burn' -%}burn
  {%- when 's-tight', 's-pain' -%}tight
  {%- when 's-ulcer' -%}ulcer
  {%- when 's-bands' -%}bands
  {%- when 's-tongue' -%}tongue
{%- endcase -%}
